riptblox.com/images/photo/6983755235987d06cf96eeb4-1774561168297.png"}},"text":"i need to know or i can't fix the problem","parent":{"_id":"69f648e731dd632a7a529440","commentBy":{"_id":"68c83bed39a0b37ab48ae8ba","username":"sa*avrilchuk1","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"68c83bed39a0b37ab48ae8ba"},"text":"Bro, there’s a little problem in your script: when you activate this ability, I freeze and these projections appear, but when I pass through them, for others I’m just frozen. And when I reach the last one, others see it as just a straight pass. Can you somehow fix it? I had the same problem too, but I fixed it."},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-03T00:55:35.677Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69f71ae9c2440051409e43ec","commentBy":{"_id":"68c83bed39a0b37ab48ae8ba","username":"sa*avrilchuk1","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2025-09-15T16:16:45.212Z","lastActive":"2026-10-04T18:39:24.227Z","status":"offline","id":"68c83bed39a0b37ab48ae8ba","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Well, it's just that when I planned my movements with the Z key, other players don't see it when moving through them, and it just looks like teleportation. For example, when I plan some movements like just circling, making a circle a couple of times, then when moving through it, it will just look like a teleport or a fast straight-line movement.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-05-03T09:52:41.250Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69f94b17c122ee643da3616c","commentBy":{"_id":"6983755235987d06cf96eeb4","username":"nagizaronagi","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/418a895f058ce75ba60c3719708464030e05f52e4d3384cd9ae98a439b929d93